  "caveats": [
    "The shared output schema (prompts._OUTPUT_CONTRACT) requires every variant to emit atomic_claims, counterevidence, and failure_flags, so the neutral control is also asked for them and will produce some. These checks measure amount rather than presence, so the contrast survives, but it is compressed relative to a design where the control emitted nothing. Registered in PREREGISTRATION.md A2.1.",
    "Items where a role's record is absent under any variant are excluded from that role's contrast rather than scored as zero. Scoring an absent record would conflate a refused or truncated call with a performed-but-empty operation, and section 4 forbids imputing missing agents."
